    "templates.starter.brainstorming.body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !Instructions\n> Write the topic under Goal, then list every idea without judging it.\n> Group the ideas, pick the best few and give each a next step.\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## Goal\n\n## Ideas\n\n- \n\n## Groups\n\n## Next steps\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !说明\n> 在“目标”下写下主题，然后列出所有想法，先不做评判。\n> 把想法分组，挑出最好的几个，并为每个写下下一步。\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## 目标\n\n## 想法\n\n- \n\n## 分组\n\n## 下一步\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.brainstorming.title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brainstorming"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "头脑风暴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.daily-report.body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "---\ntitle: Daily Report {{date}}\n---\n\n> # !Instructions\n> Fill this in at the end of the day. {{date}} is replaced with today's date\n> in each note made from this template.\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## Done today\n\n- \n\n## In progress\n\n- \n\n## Blockers\n\n- \n\n## Plan for tomorrow\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "---\ntitle: 日报 {{date}}\n---\n\n> # !说明\n> 每天结束时填写。用这个模板新建的每篇笔记中，{{date}} 都会替换为当天的日期。\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## 今日完成\n\n- \n\n## 进行中\n\n- \n\n## 阻碍\n\n- \n\n## 明日计划\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.daily-report.title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daily Report"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日报"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.debugging.body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !Instructions\n> Describe what you expected and what happened, then record each attempt\n> and what it showed. Finish with the cause and the fix.\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## Expected behavior\n\n## Actual behavior\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. \n\n## Attempts\n\n- \n\n## Cause\n\n## Fix\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !说明\n> 描述你预期的结果和实际发生的情况，然后记录每次尝试\n> 以及它说明了什么。最后写下原因和修复方法。\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## 预期行为\n\n## 实际行为\n\n## 复现步骤\n\n1. \n\n## 尝试\n\n- \n\n## 原因\n\n## 修复\n\n- [ ] \n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.debugging.title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Debugging"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.learning.body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !Instructions\n> Note the source and what you want to learn. Write the key points in your\n> own words, then questions, then a short summary you could teach from.\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## Source\n\n## What I want to learn\n\n## Key points\n\n- \n\n## Questions\n\n- \n\n## Summary\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "> # !说明\n> 记下来源和你想学的内容。用自己的话写下要点，\n> 然后是问题，最后写一段足以讲给别人听的简短总结。\n\n# {{title}}\n\n## 来源\n\n## 我想学什么\n\n## 要点\n\n- \n\n## 问题\n\n- \n\n## 总结\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "templates.starter.learning.title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Learning"
          }
        },
